@startuml 时序图-用户注册与登录
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
autonumber

actor 学生 as Student
participant "ConsoleApp\n(迭代三为 LoginFrame)" as UI
participant UserService as US
participant PasswordEncoder as PE
participant UserDao as UD
database "SQLite" as DB

== 注册 ==
Student -> UI : 输入用户名/密码/昵称
UI -> US : register(UserCommand)
US -> US : 校验用户名格式、密码强度、昵称长度
US -> UD : existsByUsername(username)
UD -> DB : SELECT 1 FROM users WHERE username = ?
DB --> UD : 结果
UD --> US : false
US -> PE : encode(rawPassword)
PE --> US : pbkdf2$迭代次数$盐$派生值
US -> UD : insert(new User(...ACTIVE, 信用 100))
UD -> DB : INSERT INTO users ...
DB --> UD : 自增主键
UD --> US : userId
US --> UI : 注册成功的 User
UI --> Student : 提示"注册成功"

== 登录 ==
Student -> UI : 输入用户名/密码
UI -> US : login(username, rawPassword)
US -> UD : findByUsername(username)
UD -> DB : SELECT ... FROM users WHERE username = ?
DB --> UD : 用户记录 / 空
alt 用户不存在或密码错误
    US --> UI : AuthenticationException("用户名或密码错误")
    UI --> Student : 统一错误提示（防账号枚举）
else 账号已封禁
    US --> UI : AuthenticationException("账号已被封禁")
else 校验通过
    US -> PE : matches(rawPassword, storedHash)
    PE --> US : true
    US -> UD : touchLastLogin(userId, now)
    UD -> DB : UPDATE users SET last_login_at = ?
    US --> UI : 最新 User
    UI --> Student : 进入主界面
end
@enduml
